# Browser
# Blade of the Swarm's trigger with two exiled cards that have warp to aim at (CR 115.1, 702.185a): Bot1 warps Haliya and
# Bygone Colossus on turn 1, and both are exiled at the end step. Every candidate is in exile, a pile a card cannot be
# clicked in until it is looked into, so the page opens Bot1's exile on its own, as it opens the graveyards for
# Reanimate, and Bot1 clicks Haliya there. She goes to the bottom of Bot1's library; the Colossus stays in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Swamp
Bygone Colossus
Haliya, Guided by Light
Blade of the Swarm
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Haliya, Guided by Light.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bygone Colossus.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Exile = Haliya, Guided by Light; Bygone Colossus
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Blade of the Swarm.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Put target exiled card)
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = 2 possible targets
? Client.Bot1.Exile.Open = true
Bot1.Target(Haliya, Guided by Light)
? Client.Bot1.Exile.Open = false
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Exile = Bygone Colossus
Bot1.Library = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Haliya, Guided by Light
